il.  Then, pour in the sugar, and stir gently until it becomes thick and syrup-like. Turn down the heat and leave to simmer. Incorporate 1 tsp baking powder, 3.3 tbsp ground walnuts, 2 tsp cardamom, 1.33 cup sugar, and 4.17 cup water smoothly until evenly distributed."}]]}],["$","li","3",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Fry Until Golden & Crisp"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Carefully lower each piece of dough into the frying oil. Fry until golden brown. When golden brown, take the Baghlaw pieces out of the oil, and place them into the sugar syrup to coat."}]]}],["$","li","4",{"children":[["$","h3",null,{"children":"Cool, Garnish & Serve"}],["$","p",null,{"children":"Remove from the syrup and whilst still warm, sprinkle with ground walnuts, so they stick to the Baghlaw. Leave to cool. Then, enjoy with your friends and family!"}]]}]]}],["$","ul",null,{"children":[["$","li","viral-4",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/recipes/crispy-pistachio-kunafa-cheese-roll/","children":"Crispy Pistachio Kunafa Cheese Roll"}]}],["$","li","viral-14",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/recipes/thai-coconut-mango-sticky-rice-parfait/","children":"Thai Coconut Mango Sticky Rice Parfait"}]}],["$","li","viral-17",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/recipes/cardamom-saffron-rasmalai-milk-cake/","children":"Cardamom Saffron Rasmalai Milk Cake"}]}],["$","li","viral-18",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/recipes/warm-honey-cardamom-gulab-jamun/","children":"Warm Honey Cardamom Gulab Jamun"}]}],["$","li","mdb-53120",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/recipes/bleskiver/","children":"Æbleskiver"}]}],["$","li","mdb-53049",{"children":["$","a",null,{"href":"/recipes/apam-balik/","children":"Apam balik"}]}]]}]]}]}]
